/// The lifecycle status of a registry record. A record is DRAFT before it
/// is submitted, PENDING_APPROVAL while it awaits curator review, and
/// APPROVED after it is approved and discoverable. Rejecting a newer
/// revision keeps the last approved revision discoverable. A DEPRECATED
/// record isn't discoverable. CREATING , UPDATING , CREATE_FAILED , and
/// UPDATE_FAILED reflect an asynchronous change that is in progress or has
/// failed. CREATE_PENDING_AUTH and UPDATE_PENDING_AUTH mean that the record
/// waits for a GitHub user to authorize access before it synchronizes from
/// its GitHub source.
